      "comment": "SCHEMING MCLEAN (2) missed the frame latest when fifth at Horsham (23.83) but scored three back at this track (22.27). Worth another chance. BROTHER BUB (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.46) at Ballarat behind Zipping Dorian in a Mix 6/7. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Winning chance. BETTY DEEDS (7) hit the frame on debut then last start flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with maiden win, scoring by 5 lengths at this track over 390m (22.23). Has the ability and looks a key chance again. MYSTIC LULU (3) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
